<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 349.85 mln rand S.African bonds Wed.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 349.85 mln rand S.African bonds Wed.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of 349.85 million rand's worth of South African bonds on Wednesday after buying 163.83 million rand's worth Tuesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
